    "Hearthblock lighting pass (docs/00_dev_roadmap/255_hearthblock_lighting_pass.md). Applies only in the main world scene.",
    "enabled is the startup default; Development > Hearthblock lighting flips it at runtime. Off restores every value above and in the scene exactly.",
    "Colors are sRGB (stockpile colors are converted for their linear vertex overlay). underground_fill lifts sealed air above black with a dim cool tint; view_fill lights actor/prop faces turned toward the camera underground.",
